  "draggable": "Kisobola okusikibwa",
  "restore-card-wip-limit-reached": "Olukalala __list__ lutuuse ku kkomo lyalwo erya WIP. Zzaawo ekaadi ku lukalala olulala:",
  "restore-card-no-list-with-room": "Buli lukalala ku lubaawo luno lutuuse ku kkomo lyalwo erya WIP. Yongeza ekkomo, oba kyusa oba twala amakaadi mu tterekero, okuzzaawo ekaadi eno.",
  "restore-all-skipped-wip-limit": "Amakaadi __count__ tegazziddwawo: enkalala zaago zituuse ku kkomo lyazo erya WIP. Gazzeewo limu limu okulonda olukalala olulala.",
  "card-blocked": "Kiziyiddwa",
